   "title": "Coway air purifier earns spot on TIME's best inventions list",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/companies/20261027/coway-air-purifier-earns-spot-on-times-best-inventions-list",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
