   "title": "KRX activates buy-side sidecar for KOSPI on sharp rise",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261027/krx-activates-buy-side-sidecar-for-kospi-on-sharp-rise",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "published": "Tue, 27 Oct 2026 02:22:03 GMT",
   "_dt": 1793067723.0,
   "ageDays": 0.02,
   "summary": "Korea's bourse operator on Tuesday activated a buy-side sidecar for the benchmark Korea Composite Stock Price Index (KOSPI) as the stock index rose sharply. Program trading for the KOSPI-listed shares was suspended for five minutes at 10:13 a.m., according to the Korea Exchange (KRX).",
   "summary_zh": "韩国交易所运营商周二为基准的韩国综合股价指数（KOSPI）启动了买方临时停牌机制，原因是股市指数大幅上涨。据韩国交易所（KRX）称，KOSPI上市股票的程序化交易于上午10点13分暂停五分钟。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Korea's bourse operator on Tuesday activated a buy-side sidecar for the benchmark Korea Composite Stock Price Index (KOSPI) as the stock index rose sharply. Program trading for the KOSPI-listed shares was suspended for five minutes at 10:13 a.m., according to the Korea Exchange (KRX). After opening 3.46 percent higher, the KOSPI gained 241.75 points, or 4.42 percent, to 5,711.22 as of 10:20 a.m. The index rallied on the back of overnight Wall Street gains, as renewed optimism over artificial intelligence (AI) and falling oil prices boosted investor sentiment. A buy-side sidecar is triggered when the KOSPI 200 Futures Index rises 5 percent or more for at least one minute",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
   "country": [
    "af"
   ],
   "topic": [
    "ene"
   ],
   "tier": 4,
   "actor": "第三方",
