   "title": "Delhi records season-low for second day as temp drops to 16.2°C, air quality worsens",
   "url": "https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/delhi-records-season-low-16-2-c-for-second-day-as-air-quality-worsens-101793065318810.html",
