   "title": "We’re not part of Rainbow Coalition",
   "url": "https://dailytrust.com/were-not-part-of-rainbow-coalition-ondo-pdp-candidate/",
   "domain": "dailytrust.com",
   "source": "Daily Trust（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Tue, 27 Oct 2026 01:19:14 +0000",
   "_dt": 1793063954.0,
   "ageDays": 0.07,
   "summary": "The Peoples Democratic Party (PDP) candidate for the Akure North/Akure South Federal Constituency, Babatunde Faro, has stated that the party has not joined the Wike-led Rainbow Coalition, pending directives from its national leadership. Faro stated this during a press conference in Akure, Ondo State, explaining that the PDP leadership has yet to communicate its official position on the proposed coalition to members at the grassroots level.",
   "summary_zh": "阿库雷北/阿库雷南联邦选区人民民主党（PDP）候选人巴巴通德·法罗表示，在等待全国领导层指示期间，该党尚未加入由维基领导的彩虹联盟。法罗在翁多州阿库雷举行的新闻发布会上表示，PDP领导层尚未向基层成员传达对该拟议联盟的正式立场。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The Peoples Democratic Party (PDP) candidate for the Akure North/Akure South Federal Constituency, Babatunde Faro, has stated that the party has not joined the Wike-led Rainbow Coalition, pending directives from its national leadership. Faro stated this during a press conference in Akure, Ondo State, explaining that the PDP leadership has yet to communicate its official position on the proposed coalition to members at the grassroots level. “On the Wike Rainbow Coalition, we know that we can take a decision to be part of them, but we have not received any order from the national leadership, so we don’t belong yet,” he said. When asked which presidential candidate he would support in the 2027 general election, Faro maintained that the PDP’s presidential candidate remains Sandy Ojang Onor. “Our presidential candidate still remains Sandy Onor as the PDP candidate,” he declared. According to him, the party will make a firm decision regarding possible coalitions and alliances with other political parties closer to the 2027 general election. “One month or so to the 2027 poll, the party will take a firm decision on any coalition levels or any alliances with any party. And from then, as a party man, I am obligated and bound by it, and I will make my own position known,” Faro said. Addressing the conduct of the upcoming 2027 elections, Faro urged the Independent National Electoral Commission (INEC) to improve its operational efficiency and ensure that votes count. Join Daily Trust WhatsApp Community For Quick Access To News and Happenings Around You",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
   "country": [
    "ng"
   ],
   "topic": [
    "pol"
   ],
   "tier": 4,
   "actor": "第三方",
   "alsoUS": false,
   "cnHit": false,
