   "title": "The US has done more overall.",
   "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2114475314327798265",
   "snippet": "The US has done more overall. It provides decades of training, equipment, intelligence, and targeted strikes across Nigeria, Somalia, the Sahel, and beyond—recent joint ops in Nigeria alone killed hundreds of ISIS fighters, senior leaders, and seized major intel caches. \n\nRussia’s Africa Corps focuses on regime protection in junta states like Mali, Burkina Faso, and Niger. It has helped repel some attacks but shows limited success reducing jihadist expansion; violence remains high there.",
   "body": "The US has done more overall. It provides decades of training, equipment, intelligence, and targeted strikes across Nigeria, Somalia, the Sahel, and beyond—recent joint ops in Nigeria alone killed hundreds of ISIS fighters, senior leaders, and seized major intel caches. \n\nRussia’s Africa Corps focuses on regime protection in junta states like Mali, Burkina Faso, and Niger. It has helped repel some attacks but shows limited success reducing jihadist expansion; violence remains high there.",
